WEBVTT

00:07:24.038 --> 00:07:31.038
and why it might not be such a given that
the actual value of it is the truth

00:07:31.038 --> 00:07:36.079
and is enlightenment and is wisdom and
why that doesn't seem so appealing in

00:07:36.079 --> 00:07:36.579
the moment.

00:07:36.871 --> 00:07:42.454
Yeah, interesting. So if pride
is what fuels overconfidence,

00:07:42.454 --> 00:07:44.621
I think humility is what gives
us the freedom and

00:07:44.621 --> 00:07:48.996
the flexibility to rethink the opinions
and assumptions we should be questioning.

00:07:49.829 --> 00:07:54.288
And I think that part of the
problem is that we live in

00:07:54.288 --> 00:07:56.996
a culture where people are rewarded
for being the smartest person in

00:07:56.996 --> 00:08:01.829
the room and they learn to wield their
knowledge and expertise like a weapon,